<newsitem itemid="361774" id="root" date="1997-02-06" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: ICI Q4 pretax profit falls.</title>
<headline>ICI Q4 pretax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.5		    vs 15.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     105		    vs 193</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,555		  vs 2,561</p>
<p>NOTE: Pretax and earnings per share figures exclude exceptional items. Including exceptionals, Q4 pretax profit was 113 million stg versus 178 million, while the EPS was 8.8p versus 12.3p.  </p>
<p>					 full year</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		48.6		   vs 76.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 19.5		   vs 18.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 32.0		   vs 30.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     603		    vs 951</p>
<p> Turnover		   10,520		 vs 10,269</p>
<p>NOTE: Pretax and earnings per share figures exclude exceptional items. Including exceptionals, year pretax profit was 498 million stg versus 927 million stg. EPS was 37.9p versus 73.9p.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast year pre-tax, pre-exceptional profits in a range between 575.0 and 650.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Imperial Chemical Industries Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
